#: luci-app-sqm-autorate/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/sqm.js:338
msgid ""
"When enabled, this WAN's delay threshold is periodically tightened or "
"relaxed to track omr-metrics' congestion score for this interface (loss, "
"jitter, TC queue, signal quality) instead of relying only on cake-autorate's "
"own delay measurement. This restarts this WAN's autorate instance whenever "
"the threshold actually changes; other WANs are not affected. Turning it off "
"restores the baseline delay threshold below on the next tracker cycle. "
"Requires omr-metrics."
msgstr ""

